WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.346 --> 00:00:02.267
Automation should save time,

2
00:00:02.317 --> 00:00:04.047
not create mistakes.

3
00:00:05.346 --> 00:00:07.556
If customers receive duplicate messages

4
00:00:07.606 --> 00:00:09.299
or follow-ups after booking,

5
00:00:09.349 --> 00:00:10.573
I audit the trigger,

6
00:00:10.623 --> 00:00:13.939
filters, timing, and exit conditions.

7
00:00:13.989 --> 00:00:15.826
I add checks for duplicates,

8
00:00:15.876 --> 00:00:18.278
opt-outs, and appointment status,

9
00:00:18.328 --> 00:00:21.741
then test normal and failure scenarios before launch.

10
00:00:21.791 --> 00:00:23.304
That creates workflows your team can

11
00:00:23.354 --> 00:00:25.203
understand, troubleshoot,

12
00:00:25.253 --> 00:00:27.583
and maintain with more confidence.

